 social platform built for discovering, viewing, and sharing immersive content in VR. On Fyta, people from around the world share daily moments, interesting stories, and spatial experiences in a more vivid and engaging way. Explore a wide range of immersive 3D content, follow the stories that interest you, and enjoy social experiences that feel more present on Quest. Whether you want to watch, discover new perspectives, or share moments of your own, Fyta makes it easy to connect through spatial media.\nFrom everyday life to creative expression, Fyta brings immersive social content to VR.", "short_description": "Fyta is a spatial social platform for discovering, viewing, and sharing everyday moments, stories, and immersive 3D content in VR."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://fyta.vision/fyta_privacy_policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Fyta", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://fyta.vision/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1228796255027646"}, {"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25848087574887375"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1855776608464028"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1855776608464028"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1773967500, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1855776608464028"}]}, "liveChannel":